#, c-format
msgid "You hear someone summoning something, and %s appear."
msgstr "Vous entendez quelqu'un invoquer quelque chose, et des %s apparaissent."

msgid "You hear the howling of the CwnAnnwn..."
msgstr "Vous entendez hurler les Cwn Annwn..."

msgid "You hear the pages make an unpleasant rustling sound."
msgstr "Vous entendez les pages émettre un bruissement déplaisant."

msgid "You hear the quarterback calling the play."
msgstr "Vous entendez le quarterback annoncer la combinaison."

